Model VR_SuperShotgun
{
	Path "Models/Weapons/hud/RS_Weapon/VR_SuperShotgun"
	Model 0 "ssg.md3"
	Skin 0 "WPN-SSHTGUN.png"
	Scale 1.35 1.35 1.35

	// THE SPAWN FRAME, WHICH IS WHY A DROPPED SSG WAS INVISIBLE ON
	// ULTIMATE DOOM. Added 2026-08-08.
	//
	// VR_SuperShotgun spawns in the world as SGN2 A (RS_Shotgun-style
	// Spawn state, RS_SuperShotgun.zs), and SGN2A0 is a DOOM 2 lump --
	// verified absent from doom.wad and present in doom2.wad. The repo
	// ships no SGN2 of its own and this block had no FrameIndex for it,
	// so on doom.wad an SSG elite drop or pedestal fill had NO SPRITE
	// AND NO MODEL: an actor that ticks, is reachable and renders
	// nothing. Exactly the PSP1/BFP1/PLP1/RLP1 defect fixed earlier the
	// same day, in the one family that pass did not cover because its
	// spawn sprite EXISTS -- just not in every IWAD.
	//
	// Mapping it to the model rather than extracting SGN2 from the IWAD:
	// the other five sprite-backed families already render their own
	// mesh in the world (SHTG A, CHGG A, REVO A, RIFK A, SAWG A all have
	// FrameIndex entries), so this makes the SSG consistent with them
	// instead of alone in showing a vanilla pickup graphic, and it costs
	// no IWAD art at all.
	USEACTORPITCH
	USEACTORROLL
	FrameIndex SGN2 A 0 0   FrameIndex SGN2 A 1 0
	FrameIndex SHT2 A 0 0   FrameIndex SHT2 A 1 0
	FrameIndex SHT2 B 0 1   FrameIndex SHT2 B 1 1
	FrameIndex SHT2 C 0 2   FrameIndex SHT2 C 1 2
	FrameIndex SHT2 D 0 3   FrameIndex SHT2 D 1 3
	FrameIndex SHT2 E 0 4   FrameIndex SHT2 E 1 4
	FrameIndex SHT2 F 0 5   FrameIndex SHT2 F 1 5
	FrameIndex SHT2 G 0 6   FrameIndex SHT2 G 1 6
	FrameIndex SHT2 H 0 7   FrameIndex SHT2 H 1 7
	FrameIndex SHT2 I 0 8   FrameIndex SHT2 I 1 8
	FrameIndex SHT2 J 0 9   FrameIndex SHT2 J 1 9
	FrameIndex SHT2 K 0 10  FrameIndex SHT2 K 1 10
	FrameIndex SHT2 L 0 11  FrameIndex SHT2 L 1 11
	FrameIndex SHT2 M 0 12  FrameIndex SHT2 M 1 12
	FrameIndex SHT2 N 0 13  FrameIndex SHT2 N 1 13
	FrameIndex SHT2 O 0 14  FrameIndex SHT2 O 1 14
	FrameIndex SHT2 P 0 15  FrameIndex SHT2 P 1 15
	FrameIndex SHT2 Q 0 16  FrameIndex SHT2 Q 1 16
	FrameIndex SHT2 R 0 17  FrameIndex SHT2 R 1 17
	FrameIndex SHT2 S 0 18  FrameIndex SHT2 S 1 18
